<title>USA: AMEX to list LEAPS on Allstate on Dec 13.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list LEAPS on Allstate on Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Tuesday it would begin trading Long Term Equity Anticipation Securities (LEAPS) on Allstate Corp on December 13.</p>
<p>The exchange said the LEAPS would open with strike prices of 50, 60 and 70 and will have expirations in January 1998 and January 1999.</p>
<p>Shares of the property-liability and life insurance company closed Tuesday at 58, up 1/8.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
